<view class="qualification-page">
  <view class="qualification-hero"><text class="qualification-title">工程师资格资料</text><text class="qualification-desc">提交学历、证书、项目案例等资料，管理员审核后更新资格状态。</text></view>
  <view class="qualification-card notice"><text class="notice-title">上传说明</text><text>支持微信聊天文件和手机相册图片；单个文件不超过 {{maxFileMb}}MB，最多 {{10}} 份。</text><text>提交、补充或删除资料后，资格状态会变为“待审核”。</text></view>
  <view class="qualification-card"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">已提交资料（{{files.length}}/{{10}}）</text><button class="choose-button {{uploading ? 'disabled' : ''}}" disabled="{{uploading}}" bindtap="choose">{{uploading ? uploadText : '上传资料'}}</button></view><view class="file-row" wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="fileId"><view class="file-main" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="open"><text class="file-icon">{{item.kind === 'IMAGE' ? '图' : '文'}}</text><view class="file-copy"><text class="file-name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="file-meta">{{item.sizeText}} · 点击查看</text></view></view><button class="remove-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !files.length}}">尚未提交资格资料</view><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载资料…</view></view>
</view>
